      FUNCTION HTTPPOST(URL, CTYPE, BODY, TARGET)
* mvx-lang/curl — POST BODY to URL via libcurl through jBASE DEFC (JBCURLPOST),
* writing the response to TARGET and returning the HTTP status (-1 transport
* error, -2 cannot open TARGET).  TLS, redirects and the Content-Type header are
* libcurl's.  GPL-2.0-only.
*
* TARGET, not PATH: jBASE reserves a long list of ordinary words, and a reserved
* name as a parameter fails at compile time with an error that names the line
* rather than the word.
      DEFC VAR JBCURLPOST(VAR, VAR, VAR, VAR)
      CT = TRIM(CTYPE)
      IF CT = "" THEN CT = "application/json"
      RC = JBCURLPOST(URL, CT, BODY, TARGET)
      RETURN(RC)
